      "role": "user",
      "content": "The banners are in the dirt. Everything... everything we built, everyone we swore to protect... it's all gone. I can hear them coming through the breach. I just look at my hands and I don't even recognize the man who led them. There's no way out of this, is there? Just more blood and more shame. I'm so tired of even breathing.",
